Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:54.30,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(727,0)\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}Unprecedented
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna knock us off if\Nyou keep crashing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's too injured to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His retinas were damaged\Nin that last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that? Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It started running like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let it go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire the transporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah, don't do this. Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that he made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Sodom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told Sodom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take on your share and carry\Neveryone the rest of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were in its stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm full already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take him with us as backup food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro! Come here quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some pirates gave Sodom and\NGomorrah a serious beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates have got a lot of nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never touch my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for a dance party!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're headed straight for a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll crash into it and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead end?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see one, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:03:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I see anything of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the courthouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wore it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units, the King Bull carrying\Nthe pirates broke through Block D,
