Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeat, the King Bull carrying\Nthe pirates broke through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Fogfreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A golden transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having this little gadget is the same as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having the authority\Nto issue a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I have the same\Npower as a Navy Admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or someone even higher up than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admiral Aokiji entrusted it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, if\Nand when will I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I revive the ancient weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this won't just be something\Nthat's on loan to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry it on my own accord, along\Nwith the power to control an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a single push of a button,\Nan entire island will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Authority can be a weapon unto itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team Spandam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you even knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost accidentally hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir, but I'm\Nafraid we've got an emergency here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an urgent call from\NEnies Lobby's main island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's an emergency, why didn't\Nthey just call my room directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is the receiver off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, either way, you were saying\Nsomething about an emergency, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miss Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems we have an urgent report coming
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in from the Marines\Ndown at the main island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing what it's likely about, I\Nwouldn't call it an emergency, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends tried their best, but only\Nmanaged to take down five of our soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how they were\Nultimately defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did some of my other men bring them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it the giant gatekeeping\Nteam of Oimo and Kashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we listen to the report?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About those idiots who\Ndefied the world government?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and learn their fate together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you lowlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Spandam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand you have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chiefs spawned him, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried your direct line,\Nbut I couldn't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure where to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, just pick up from\Nwhere your last report ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the gritty details,\Nloudly and clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, the intruders - Did\Nyou accidentally kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity, it's their fault\Nfor being such weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The intruders consist of about 60 pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've pushed their way\Nall the way through the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,main island and have reached\Nthe courthouse plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop them, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All personnel on Enies Lobby's main island\Nhead to the courthouse plaza immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a good job, Gomorrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear everything you two\Ndid will not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're breaking in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to say big bro breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pirates have reached\Nthe Courthouse Plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whether he's up on the roof or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not exactly like we\Ncan just jump up after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many members of CP9\Ndid you see up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just that one big\Nguy with the bullhorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that Robin, Franky,\Nall of them are right behind those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, we need\Nto catch up with Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can save Robin together! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the courthouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The draw break isn't down yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corner them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That frog's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same ball\Nthat took out Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who threw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's three of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the ones that attacked first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go around chasing every\Nenemy that runs off like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pipe down. It's confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of them need to\Nbe chased, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find out who we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have superhuman strength to\Nswing something like that around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's part of some\Nspecial unit like those guard dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are probably more of them\Nhiding out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the\Nreinforcements have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surround them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll be able\Nto open those heavy stone doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have them cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, how...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna open those big stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going in first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay close, don't fall behind! He...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he cut right through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Samba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to charge both of those towers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because each side has a lever\Nto open up that drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thinking! I'm on it! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we need to\Nsplit into three teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of you go with Kiwi and\NMozu, the rest are with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll crack some heads in that courthouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:11:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, everyone! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
