Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the gatekeepers of the main\Nisland front gate, Oimo and Kashi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have joined up with the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're currently destroying the\Ncentral part of the main island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After hearing all the field reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our guard casualties total\Nmust be over 2,000 men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, not five?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man who took down over\N1,000 of those men all by himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the notorious Straw Hat Luffy,\Nhas suddenly disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still assessing the situation here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the history of this island, this is\Nwithout a doubt the absolute worst thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it never happened in any slobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Blueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing out there on that rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baskerville!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief Justice Baskerville!\NCome in! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Chief Spandam.
