Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.70,0:13:24.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(470,355)\fscx110\fscy110\fnRoboto\b1\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8}Courthouse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is left, Baskerville, on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is right, Baskerville, on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And located in the center,\Nit is none other than I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Central freeway closed for repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a status report, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the intruders have\Nmade it to the Courthouse Plaza or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A status report, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a tricky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not so much in the plaza\Nas they are inside the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just awful. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, Chief Justice, I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates have cut through our\Ndefenses and broken down the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're currently inside the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can see that already, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as much resistance as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be able to tear right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got three heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just like that dog that\Nguards the underworld. Marverous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Cerberus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order in the court, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a sacred chamber\Nof law, you hooligans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had the nerve to bust in here, so shut\Nup, sit still, and receive your sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You head to the roof and\Njoin up with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll stay here at the door with\NYokozuna and hold off the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll watch your back, so keep moving\Nand don't worry about the small fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it looks like they're starting\Nsome kind of trial over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Just ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are stairs on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ignoring the trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they're pirates, but seriously,\Nhow rude can these guys get?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock the Judicial Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you some respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are his sword spinning\Nor am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charming demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleepless knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he the guy who broke the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's that. Now\Nlet's get moving, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He puts all of us to shame and he's\Nnot even the captain of their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey hey hey wait out of the way reindeer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of the way moss\Nhead i'm coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot about him somebody's gotta protect\Nnami from all these bad guys and that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somebody's Gonna be me damn it no watch\Nit what why is he picking a fight now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to settle this, then bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your fault for trying\Nto hog Nami all for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came to this place to\Nrescue Robin, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she's waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's waiting for her prince to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably crying right now\Nbecause she misses me so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you screw this up when the\Nstairs are right in front of your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you stopped giving such crappy\Ndirections, this wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not blaming this on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:17:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, I'll try to make you some medicine\Nlater to fix your brain problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brain problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, make some\Nfor him while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try, but he may be beyond help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to have doubts\Nabout this whole rescue thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll pull it together when\Nthe going gets tough, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are serious crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, they're quite grave indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we should show restraint and\Nsentence them to death. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can ignore\Nthe Chief Justice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Nami, go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make quick work of this thing\Nand catch up with you in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:17:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a thing now, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And easy to defeat, no less?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the meaning\Nof fear, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He-ho-he-he-he!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta go through us first, Cerberus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.76,0:18:41.02,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,80)\fscx175\fscy175\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(481,0)\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}Luffy vs. Blueno\NCourthouse Rooftop
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.76,0:18:41.02,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,80)\fscx175\fscy175\b600\bord0\c&HE5E6E7&\blur0.8\fad(481,0)}Luffy vs. Blueno\NCourthouse Rooftop
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My face closed! Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All open doors will eventually shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you still managed\Nto dodge my Tempest kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely keeping up with my speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even changed the\Ncourse of my Tempest Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His physical abilities are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you keep running into guys\Nthat are stronger and stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless you can get stronger too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't protect your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not all strong like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But either way, they're my\Nfriends and I want to keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to get stronger\Nthan anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, there's a\Nchance I could lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought of a new way to\Nfight with all my might.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that I won't lose anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I won't let anyone slip away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on inside his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to stop me now? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my strength and techniques\Njust went up by one step
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
